    "detailed_description": "Unravel the mystery behind the death of the king of Orion alongside Royolt, the king's former bodyguard, who returns to the continent to investigate a mystery from the past and find his former allies in a 2d platform action adventure of the metroidvania genre with puzzles , combats and different endings.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore a vast continent with forests, icy mountains, caves and cities full of stories and treasures<br />\r\nVarious weapons and equipment<br />\r\nCreate your ending according to your actions<br />\r\nFind gems and enchantments for your weapons<br />\r\nDiscover the backstory of the characters in sidequests and secret maps<br />\r\nFace over 50 enemy types<br />\r\nSolve various side quests",
